WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.240 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.080
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:33.330 --> 01:34.620
The wall...

01:37.230 --> 01:38.130
What is it?

01:38.630 --> 01:42.330
Remove the wall...

01:42.870 --> 01:43.770
The wall?

01:44.500 --> 01:47.370
Remove the wall of the heart.

01:48.210 --> 01:49.700
Do not fear...

01:50.840 --> 01:55.250
Do not fear the true
appearance of yourself.

01:56.180 --> 01:57.740
Accept it...

02:33.350 --> 02:36.980
Elder Misaki told me
about Shouko's existence.

02:38.760 --> 02:40.950
You knew about Shouko?

02:41.830 --> 02:45.850
He said there is no need
to bring Shouko here.

02:46.600 --> 02:48.930
Shouko's power was large...

02:49.270 --> 02:52.290
To the point that she would
lose her body right away...

02:53.040 --> 02:54.840
He said she would become...

02:54.910 --> 02:59.440
...an existence of pure consciousness
and help those that have powers.

03:01.310 --> 03:02.520
<i>Reunion</i>

03:02.520 --> 03:06.320
<i>Reunion
Episode 16</i>

03:20.670 --> 03:21.630
What's wrong?

03:21.900 --> 03:24.230
What are you thinking about, Naoya?

03:24.870 --> 03:25.800
Nothing really...

03:32.340 --> 03:33.970
Naoya, what's the matter!

03:41.690 --> 03:42.620
Naoya?

04:00.270 --> 04:01.260
You...

04:11.320 --> 04:13.650
Failure of the body would occur.

04:13.720 --> 04:16.280
I don't know how
the failure will occur.

04:17.190 --> 04:19.560
Maybe at the point it passes 30%...

04:19.630 --> 04:22.420
...the mind that was
confined in the brain...

04:22.490 --> 04:26.360
...may become an existence
that is unrelated to the body.

04:30.170 --> 04:31.230
Damn it!

04:39.450 --> 04:40.540
Are you okay?

04:41.280 --> 04:42.340
Ah, yeah...

04:44.850 --> 04:46.150
How are you feeling?

04:46.350 --> 04:47.840
Nothing's wrong.

04:48.190 --> 04:50.880
It's just that my
consciousness is a little out of it.

04:51.120 --> 04:54.150
It's because we experienced
a thing like that in the forest.

04:55.060 --> 04:56.760
Yeah, that's true.

04:58.960 --> 05:00.690
Did you see something?

05:00.970 --> 05:03.300
Like the future or the past...

05:03.700 --> 05:04.900
Nothing...

05:12.010 --> 05:13.100
Brother...

05:14.010 --> 05:17.570
Am I going to end up like Shouko?

05:20.390 --> 05:25.150
My body will disappear and become
an existence of pure consciousness.

05:27.330 --> 05:30.960
T-There is no way
that is going to happen.

05:36.570 --> 05:38.900
Shouko's power was large...

05:39.200 --> 05:42.170
To the point that she would
lose her body right away...

05:50.380 --> 05:52.080
This is Shouko's notebook.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.350
Yeah...

06:07.800 --> 06:08.530
Naoya!

06:11.100 --> 06:12.470
What's wrong?

06:16.540 --> 06:18.240
You screamed all of a sudden.

06:19.210 --> 06:20.240
Naoya...

06:24.350 --> 06:27.620
What are you going to do
looking at Shouko's notebook?

06:28.290 --> 06:31.590
I feel like I will be
able to read it now...

06:44.000 --> 06:45.730
I can read it, Brother.

06:48.370 --> 06:51.470
No, I'm not reading it.

06:51.880 --> 06:54.610
When I follow the writing,
I understand its meanings!

07:02.720 --> 07:08.090
In the past, all humans knew that
they had a hidden power within them.

07:08.390 --> 07:12.990
Also, they were living in a more
advanced civilization than now.

07:13.070 --> 07:15.000
There were eras like that.

07:15.400 --> 07:17.100
10,000 BC...

07:18.540 --> 07:21.770
It's way too off from reality.

07:21.910 --> 07:24.030
It's okay. Continue.

07:25.440 --> 07:30.940
People of that era thought the energy
of the mind was something from nature.

07:31.350 --> 07:33.180
They understood that...

07:33.250 --> 07:37.380
...the natural energy and the power
of the human heart were interlocked.

07:37.590 --> 07:40.790
They used energy from
meditation as their key force.

07:41.230 --> 07:44.990
They were an advanced civilization
capable of space and time travel.

07:45.160 --> 07:47.460
Atlantis and Lemuria.

07:47.530 --> 07:49.870
Another name for it
is the continent of Mu.

07:49.940 --> 07:54.570
The civilization on the two continents
was started by people from space.

07:55.210 --> 07:57.770
But they perished...

07:57.840 --> 07:59.070
Why's that?

08:01.010 --> 08:04.680
Psychic energy turned
toward the negative side.

08:05.080 --> 08:06.750
Confusion and conflict...

08:06.820 --> 08:08.680
Control and destruction...

08:09.220 --> 08:13.620
The negative energy caused
an impact on the earth's pulse.

08:13.830 --> 08:16.450
Then an extraordinary
natural phenomenon!

08:17.130 --> 08:23.030
The sun went down and a couple
of humans escaped and survived.

08:23.470 --> 08:25.060
It's Noah's Ark...

08:25.540 --> 08:27.400
The sinking continent...

08:27.710 --> 08:30.680
People tried to get on
ships and escape, but...

08:30.740 --> 08:33.870
...they were swallowed
by the monstrous waves.

08:42.590 --> 08:47.690
Although, one canoe survived
those chaotic black waves...

08:47.760 --> 08:50.750
...and landed on a
desolate small island.

08:57.540 --> 09:02.030
Eventually there came a
new era of a new civilization.

09:02.510 --> 09:05.710
The era of the material
civilization who have forgotten...

09:05.780 --> 09:07.770
...about the existence
of psychic energy.

09:09.480 --> 09:12.280
The majority of people's
powers are asleep.

09:12.550 --> 09:16.780
The organ to be able to
use it has not yet awakened.

09:17.220 --> 09:22.320
But even in this era, the psychic
energy that humans have let out...

09:22.390 --> 09:25.020
...is greatly affecting reality.

09:25.760 --> 09:29.130
Riots, wars, and
natural phenomena too...

09:30.300 --> 09:34.360
Brother, when I got outside,
I understood a lot of things.

09:34.970 --> 09:38.100
Not everyone is hoping
for peace and happiness.

09:38.440 --> 09:41.440
There are those that
wish for chaos and sadness.

09:41.850 --> 09:46.550
People are being mesmerized
by the black flow without knowing it.

09:48.250 --> 09:53.350
People will soon realize the
existence of psychic power...

09:53.860 --> 09:58.690
...and how that is affecting
peace and chaos on a large scale.

09:59.900 --> 10:04.670
Reformation is most
likely what is after that.

10:06.000 --> 10:07.600
If it's something in the future...

10:07.670 --> 10:10.570
...my head becomes muddled,
and I can't read into it.

10:11.010 --> 10:14.880
I most likely don't have the
powers to understand it yet.

10:15.850 --> 10:19.410
Just what are they
telling us we can do?

10:26.660 --> 10:27.560
Naoya?

10:27.930 --> 10:29.190
Hey, Naoya!

10:30.200 --> 10:31.130
Where are you!

10:46.650 --> 10:48.040
This place is...

11:03.000 --> 11:04.360
Shouko...

11:55.480 --> 11:56.540
Naoya...

11:57.120 --> 11:58.840
Are you waiting for someone?

12:00.690 --> 12:02.850
You look really lonely.

12:03.060 --> 12:05.620
If you don't mind me,
why don't we talk about it?

12:05.690 --> 12:07.420
I'm sorry, but I need to go.

12:08.930 --> 12:10.260
Hey!

12:22.110 --> 12:23.040
Naoya!

12:26.950 --> 12:28.470
I was worried!

12:28.550 --> 12:30.880
I waited for so long,
but you didn't come back, so...

12:30.950 --> 12:32.210
I thought...

12:32.480 --> 12:34.750
It's already night?

12:35.350 --> 12:38.550
It felt like it was only a few minutes.

12:38.620 --> 12:40.320
What did you see?

12:40.630 --> 12:43.960
A world that doesn't have
time, distance, or amount...

12:44.730 --> 12:49.460
A world where you can see
and feel many things at once.

12:50.670 --> 12:52.900
You saw Shouko?

12:55.870 --> 13:00.470
Before, when Shouko said our
existences needed for the reformation...

13:00.910 --> 13:03.810
...we felt resistance.

13:04.180 --> 13:05.380
As if we were scared...

13:06.150 --> 13:07.080
Yeah...

13:07.520 --> 13:10.280
We were wishing for a normal life.

13:10.760 --> 13:14.210
We wanted to avoid
a fate such as that.

13:14.290 --> 13:15.260
Yeah.

13:15.830 --> 13:19.890
That's why that guy
tried to kill Miss Miki then.

13:28.740 --> 13:35.700
But, you two are an essential existence
for the big reformation that's coming.

13:36.750 --> 13:37.720
Reformation?

13:37.950 --> 13:40.380
It's a transition period
for a while here on.

13:40.790 --> 13:45.350
For a human to get closer to a
mental state from a materialistic state...

13:45.420 --> 13:47.420
...complication is required.

13:48.130 --> 13:50.790
Don't forget this...

13:51.360 --> 13:55.630
Not everything is flowing
toward the positive!

14:07.780 --> 14:11.440
Because we didn't want
to receive that message...

14:11.680 --> 14:15.710
We felt a strong hatred for the
existence that was relaying that.

14:16.520 --> 14:19.120
Then that man disappeared...

14:19.830 --> 14:20.990
And that's because...

14:21.690 --> 14:24.290
...we are starting to
accept the reformation.

14:30.340 --> 14:33.400
We are accepting the reformation?

14:33.540 --> 14:34.700
Brother...

14:34.770 --> 14:38.610
We don't even know
what the reformation is, but...

14:38.940 --> 14:40.540
...we're accepting it?

14:41.350 --> 14:42.340
Naoya...

14:42.880 --> 14:44.970
Are you going to go
to where Shouko is?

14:53.830 --> 14:58.060
Why does everyone
disappear leaving me behind?

15:02.200 --> 15:03.390
Brother...

15:04.570 --> 15:07.540
I'm not going to go anywhere.

15:08.070 --> 15:10.230
I'll always be by your side.

15:11.210 --> 15:13.700
I want to be in this world.

15:14.180 --> 15:16.840
I need you, Brother...

15:17.750 --> 15:18.770
Naoya...

15:25.290 --> 15:26.260
Brother...

15:26.530 --> 15:28.080
I found out the place.

15:28.390 --> 15:30.660
The place where
Mom and Dad are...

15:42.540 --> 15:43.530
That place?

15:43.810 --> 15:45.400
That's where they are?

15:46.550 --> 15:47.910
Let's go, Brother.

15:55.150 --> 15:58.120
<i>Kirihara Watches</i>

15:56.350 --> 15:58.120
Kirihara...

15:58.190 --> 15:59.710
It's written differently?

16:00.230 --> 16:01.820
Why are they watchmakers!

16:02.330 --> 16:04.960
What happened to the toy company!

16:05.330 --> 16:06.760
Brother, look...

16:10.470 --> 16:12.730
Is that Dad?

16:15.970 --> 16:16.960
Mom!

16:20.910 --> 16:22.170
Why!

16:22.680 --> 16:24.910
Why are they that old!

16:25.550 --> 16:27.610
Reality changed...

16:28.750 --> 16:31.750
Our thoughts and
Elder Misaki's powers...

16:32.490 --> 16:36.360
Also the energy spot
from the laboratory...

16:36.430 --> 16:39.990
...most likely affected the reality.

16:40.970 --> 16:45.670
There was a time a while ago
I wished to forget about our parents.

16:47.270 --> 16:52.680
Mom and Dad were most likely
wishing the same thing too.

16:53.410 --> 16:54.540
No...

16:55.050 --> 17:01.180
Maybe this is the best
relationship for us four to have.

17:03.490 --> 17:05.510
Thank you very much.

17:10.230 --> 17:12.590
Honey, your acquaintances?

17:13.060 --> 17:14.120
No...

17:15.130 --> 17:17.570
But, maybe somewhere...

17:18.100 --> 17:19.660
Let's go, Naoya.

17:22.670 --> 17:24.110
Welcome.

17:24.280 --> 17:25.800
Is it a repair?

17:27.710 --> 17:28.680
No...

17:28.910 --> 17:30.900
I just wanted to see
some wristwatches.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.470
Is it a present?

17:32.550 --> 17:34.520
Or is it for yourself?

17:34.890 --> 17:35.910
Um...

17:36.120 --> 17:37.450
It's for himself.

17:37.620 --> 17:39.850
And let me get one too.

17:39.920 --> 17:41.450
Is that so?

17:41.530 --> 17:43.860
Then how are these over here?

17:45.200 --> 17:48.030
Please, feel free to hold it.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.070
Excuse me...

17:52.140 --> 17:53.130
Yes?

17:53.910 --> 17:55.960
How long have you had this shop?

17:56.040 --> 17:57.010
What?

17:57.880 --> 18:03.280
Well, it's been about
maybe five years?

18:03.350 --> 18:05.710
Yeah, that's about right.

18:06.220 --> 18:08.550
Naoya, how about this one?

18:10.590 --> 18:13.820
Your name is Naoya?

18:13.890 --> 18:15.420
Ah, yes...

18:17.430 --> 18:18.560
What about you?

18:18.700 --> 18:20.690
Are you two brothers?

18:21.070 --> 18:22.030
Yes.

18:22.830 --> 18:26.000
My name is Naoto.

18:26.710 --> 18:27.900
Naoto...

18:30.080 --> 18:31.410
Is there something wrong?

18:33.910 --> 18:37.940
Wow, strange things do happen...

18:40.220 --> 18:45.550
Our children's names were
also Naoto and Naoya.

18:47.130 --> 18:48.220
Were?

18:48.560 --> 18:52.120
The two of them
are not alive anymore.

18:54.000 --> 18:56.300
Because of an accident...

18:56.900 --> 18:57.660
Accident?

18:57.740 --> 18:58.630
Yes...

18:59.070 --> 19:00.560
15 years ago...

19:01.210 --> 19:04.140
In a small pond in a park nearby...

19:04.210 --> 19:08.440
...a young girl and
her mother's boat sank.

19:08.980 --> 19:13.420
By chance, Naoto and Naoya were
nearby and jumped into the pond...

19:13.490 --> 19:16.610
...to save the girl and the mother.

19:17.720 --> 19:20.920
But they ran out of energy.

19:21.460 --> 19:25.830
Afterwards, I received money
from the girl's father, and...

19:25.900 --> 19:28.990
...my store was saved
from closing down.

19:29.170 --> 19:31.140
But more than that...

19:32.070 --> 19:35.100
I am very proud...

19:35.410 --> 19:42.340
...about my kids saving that family
without worrying about their own lives.

20:07.640 --> 20:09.160
What is the meaning of this?

20:09.540 --> 20:13.810
Are they saying that this is the
best relationship for all four of us?

20:14.310 --> 20:17.110
We exist inside Mom and Dad.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.040
We are always together.

20:22.720 --> 20:24.350
Welcome.

20:28.060 --> 20:30.530
Oh, you had a repair.

20:30.600 --> 20:33.430
Um, your name was...

20:33.570 --> 20:35.230
It's Sonezaki.

20:35.430 --> 20:37.960
I was pretty sure
today was the day...

20:38.040 --> 20:39.900
Yes, it's done.

20:40.040 --> 20:41.840
Hold on a second, please.

20:47.650 --> 20:49.480
Thank you for waiting.

20:49.550 --> 20:50.340
There you go.

20:50.420 --> 20:52.250
Oh, thank you.

20:55.950 --> 20:58.790
Miss, is there something wrong?

20:59.590 --> 21:01.890
No, there's nothing.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.720
Is that so?

21:03.860 --> 21:06.830
Maybe you've
gotten sick or something.

21:06.900 --> 21:08.390
Please be careful.

21:11.570 --> 21:12.970
What are you trying to do!

21:13.040 --> 21:14.160
Brother!

21:15.240 --> 21:16.800
What are you talking about?

21:17.340 --> 21:20.040
Um, do you know each other?

21:20.450 --> 21:23.440
No, not at all.

21:27.420 --> 21:30.150
What wonderful family love.

21:30.220 --> 21:33.420
It's beautiful, seriously.

21:34.230 --> 21:35.620
Why you!

21:54.910 --> 21:57.440
Don't go against me!

22:11.000 --> 22:12.360
Are you okay?

22:13.460 --> 22:16.300
No!

22:31.250 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.590 --> 22:37.180
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.260 --> 22:41.850
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.930 --> 22:45.160
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.230 --> 22:47.860
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.270
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.710 --> 23:03.980
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.050 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.760 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.290 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.930 --> 23:24.200
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.270 --> 23:29.730
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.810 --> 23:34.610
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:40.140
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.220 --> 23:45.490
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.560 --> 23:51.020
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.100 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:00.670 --> 24:04.230
Different from truth,
the surface of a fact...

24:05.980 --> 24:09.000
The sad fate which is repeated...

24:10.750 --> 24:13.880
As we bid farewell
to the uncertain bond...

24:13.950 --> 24:18.910
...we find a ray of hope
in the inescapable flow.

24:19.690 --> 24:22.420
Along with a prelude
of a forthcoming battle...

24:23.630 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 17, "Cloud of Dust"</i>

24:26.300 --> 24:29.860
Where are we headed?
